        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through Lucie, Inc., one of only 11 CMS-approved solutions, we provide brokers and consumers a marketplace to shop, buy, and enroll in individual medical and supplemental health products.",
        "start_character": 5528,
        "end_character": 5715
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have entered into agreements with third-party vendors who manage certain elements of our information technology infrastructure services including, among other things, our information technology operations, end-user services, and platforms for cloud computing.",
        "start_character": 31110,
        "end_character": 31372
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have invested in a benefits package designed to be comprehensive, and affordable, providing protection and support to help our employees achieve health, financial, and wellness goals, with services including mental health care, fertility support, and family-building benefits.",
        "start_character": 21889,
        "end_character": 22168
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in a highly competitive environment in an industry subject to significant and ongoing changes, including business and hospital system consolidations, new strategic alliances, market pressures, scientific and technological advances in medical care and therapeutics, as well as regulatory and legislative challenges and reform both at the federal and state levels.",
        "start_character": 23804,
        "end_character": 24177
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While our Health Insurance Subsidiaries are required to meet various federal and state requirements regarding the size and composition of our participating provider networks, our business model is based on contracting with selected healthcare systems and other providers, not all systems and providers in a given area.",
        "start_character": 25454,
        "end_character": 25772
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "“Risk Factors—Risks Related to our Business—If we are unable to integrate and manage our information systems effectively, our operations could be disrupted” and “Risk Factors—Risks Related to our Business—If we or our partners or other third parties with whom we collaborate fail to protect confidential information and/or sustain a data security incident, we could suffer increased costs, material financial penalties, exposure to significant liability, adverse regulatory consequences, and reputational harm, which would materially adversely affect our business, results of operations, and financial condition.”",
        "start_character": 33227,
        "end_character": 33840
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The ACA allows individual states to choose to enact additional state-specific requirements that extend ACA mandates and some of the states where we operate have implemented higher MLR percentage requirements, lower tobacco user rating ratios, and different age curve variations.",
        "start_character": 44614,
        "end_character": 44892
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The use and disclosure of certain data that we collect or process about or from individuals are also regulated in some instances by other federal laws, including the Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act (“GLBA”), and state statutes implementing GLBA, in connection with insurance transactions in the states where we operate.",
        "start_character": 59585,
        "end_character": 59895
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also believe in the importance of investing in developmental opportunities for our employees, and all employees have access to internally created and third party skills and training programs.",
        "start_character": 22169,
        "end_character": 22363
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe competitors who lack this member engagement engine will face significant challenges in replicating our consumer experience, and our platform thus forms an important structural barrier around the innovations we have developed.",
        "start_character": 17143,
        "end_character": 17379
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
        "accession_number": "0001568651-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We compete to hire and retain highly talented individuals from all backgrounds, and we offer our employees compensation packages designed to be competitive and aligned with market best practices.",
        "start_character": 20922,
        "end_character": 21117
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001568651-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001568651-26-000011-81e50d6f62d2129b",
